  "$comment": [
    "The people seed. Money is written as decimal OMR strings and parsed to integer baisa —",
    "no float ever touches a salary, not even here.",
    "",
    "measurementStartDate is the date this person's numbers start being measured. It is the",
    "date the deal record begins, NOT the legal hire date. Several of these people were with",
    "the company before January 2026; their earlier months are out of scope because there is",
    "no deal record for them. hireDate is left null until confirmed, so the two never merge.",
    "",
    "payrollClass decides statutory cost from 1 September 2026: OmaniEmployee carries employer",
    "social insurance, ExpatEmployee carries end-of-service accrual, Contractor carries neither.",
    "Unclassified means not yet confirmed — it carries neither and is surfaced as a data gap.",
    "",
    "commissionCutPct is the person's default advisor cut. The actual cut is carried per deal,",
    "because it varies by deal in the 2026 book."
  ],
